1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,220
You know what I'm tired of?

2
00:00:02,340 --> 00:00:04,000
Men who are not smarter than me

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,900
speaking to me as if they are smarter than me.

4
00:00:08,100 --> 00:00:08,600
Stop.

5
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:10,680
Stop.

6
00:00:11,440 --> 00:00:14,340
There are a lot of men who are smarter than me,

7
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:17,140
who know more than me about a multitude of things.

8
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:19,320
But the ones who don't?

9
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:20,440
Stop.

10
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:21,640
Stop.

11
00:00:24,740 --> 00:00:27,240
I know what I know.

12
00:00:28,160 --> 00:00:32,060
And I know when I am lacking in things.

13
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:35,720
And I go to people who know more and I listen.

14
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:39,820
Take note.

